{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2022-02-02 10:06:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL NAMED TO FORTUNE MAGAZINE\'S "WORLD\'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES" LIST FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'HOUSTON, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORTUNE MAGAZINE\'S 2022 LIST OF THE "WORLD\'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES." LYONDELLBASELL HAS RECEIVED THIS DISTINCTION FOR FIVE CONSECUTIVE YEARS.'}